        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33368817?u=80d39153e27b7d191281ed9b12cfb2b414418080&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>clarify how the <code class=\"notranslate\">grid-auto-flow: column</code> example uses row tracks before adding columns</li>\n<li>point readers to <code class=\"notranslate\">grid-auto-columns</code> for sizing implicit columns</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Rationale</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The issue report describes confusion when only column tracks are defined: <code class=\"notranslate\">column</code> auto-placement creates additional implicit columns instead of wrapping items into the existing explicit columns. The note explains why the example defines rows and how implicit columns are sized.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Tests</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">git diff --check</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">npx --yes prettier@3.8.3 --check files/en-us/web/css/reference/properties/grid-auto-flow/index.md</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">npx --yes --package markdownlint-cli2@0.22.1 --package markdownlint-rule-search-replace@1.2.0 markdownlint-cli2 --config .markdownlint-cli2.jsonc files/en-us/web/css/reference/properties/grid-auto-flow/index.md</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #44282.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4537964442\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44282\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/44282/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44282\">#44282</a></p>",
